From: Antheas Kapenekakis <git@antheas.dev>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:40:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] temporarily add gdm just for nvidia to force contiguous
 allocations

Rebased onto nixpkgs gamescope 3.16.29 (upstream commit does not apply
cleanly due to unrelated refactors around bNeedsCompositeFromFilter and
the VK_FUNC macro list).

Upstream: https://github.com/antheas/gamescope/commit/fa6f7f2503c2e773acf818ad688ddd1db73df3a0
---
 src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp    | 105 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/Backends/DeferredBackend.h |  14 ++++
 src/backend.h                  |  11 +++
 src/meson.build                |   4 +-
 src/rendervulkan.cpp           | 135 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/rendervulkan.hpp           |   2 +
 6 files changed, 262 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp b/src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp
